# Intentionally minimal — no settings.
#
# This file carried `legacy-peer-deps=true` from Phase 0 to Phase 4.5, to silence
# the conflict between react-konva's peer range and the installed konva. It was
# never a fix: it told npm to ignore a real incompatibility.
#
# Resolved in Phase 5 by making the versions actually agree — konva ^9.3.22 with
# react-konva ^18.2.10, both compatible with React 18 — so npm resolves cleanly
# with no flags. See the tech-stack note in README.md for why not konva 10.
